      "chunkIndex": 0,
      "sourceLocator": "PDF物理第76页／印刷第64页，第2条"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": null,
      "chunkId": null,
      "referenceRevision": "2025.9.2",
      "knowledgeScope": "RULE_CHECK_PUBLIC_ELECTIVE_2025",
      "profileId": null,
      "chunkingVersion": "handbook-2025-clause-verbatim-v1",
      "publicationStatus": "DRAFT",
      "visibilityScope": "INTERNAL_ONLY",
      "sharingRightsConfirmed": false,
      "content": "第四条　学校选修课分为专业选修课和公共选修课。其中，专业选修课\n列入教学计划要求在规定学期内修读；公共选修课包\n括校内公选课和网络公选课，学生自行选课修读。",
      "contentChecksum": "f363ef0cf8c318e24a299ff7ccca3dace5ebaf9b64be65e038985daed5f28552",
      "span": {
        "unit": "UTF16_CODE_UNIT",
        "startInclusive": 0,
        "endExclusive": 78
      },
      "physicalPage": 76,
      "printedPage": 64,
      "locatorId": "handbook-2025-article-4",
      "article": 4,
      "chunkIndex": 1,
      "sourceLocator": "PDF物理第76页／印刷第64页，第4条"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": null,
      "chunkId": null,
      "referenceRevision": "2025.9.2",
      "knowledgeScope": "RULE_CHECK_PUBLIC_ELECTIVE_2025",
      "profileId": null,
      "chunkingVersion": "handbook-2025-clause-verbatim-v1",
      "publicationStatus": "DRAFT",
      "visibilityScope": "INTERNAL_ONLY",
      "sharingRightsConfirmed": false,
      "content": "第五条　公共选修课授课时间原则上为 16 学时，最多不超过 32 学时。",
      "contentChecksum": "94097c359d2cb712fab8a57e9b32c3096b41eb1e848ab272aed7c3bb6333b40d",
      "span": {
        "unit": "UTF16_CODE_UNIT",
        "startInclusive": 0,
        "endExclusive": 36
      },
      "physicalPage": 76,
      "printedPage": 64,
      "locatorId": "handbook-2025-article-5",
      "article": 5,
      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "sourceLocator": "PDF物理第76页／印刷第64页，第5条"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": null,
      "chunkId": null,
      "referenceRevision": "2025.9.2",
      "knowledgeScope": "RULE_CHECK_PUBLIC_ELECTIVE_2025",
      "profileId": null,
      "chunkingVersion": "handbook-2025-clause-verbatim-v1",
      "publicationStatus": "DRAFT",
      "visibilityScope": "INTERNAL_ONLY",
      "sharingRightsConfirmed": false,
      "content": "第六条　公共选修课的选课、课程组织与安排由教务处负责。其中，校\n内公选课达到一定的选课人数方可开课，选课人数一般要求 30-150 人，低于\n30 人不予开课。",
      "contentChecksum": "35910424a742c3fac925a219b7a4bc7fcac4725586e1641d30ed82c15268f2ab",
      "span": {
        "unit": "UTF16_CODE_UNIT",
        "startInclusive": 0,
        "endExclusive": 80
      },
      "physicalPage": 76,
      "printedPage": 64,
      "locatorId": "handbook-2025-article-6",
      "article": 6,
      "chunkIndex": 3,
      "sourceLocator": "PDF物理第76页／印刷第64页，第6条"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": null,
      "chunkId": null,
      "referenceRevision": "2025.9.2",
      "knowledgeScope": "RULE_CHECK_PUBLIC_ELECTIVE_2025",
      "profileId": null,
      "chunkingVersion": "handbook-2025-clause-verbatim-v1",
      "publicationStatus": "DRAFT",
      "visibilityScope": "INTERNAL_ONLY",
      "sharingRightsConfirmed": false,
      "content": "第八条　人才培养方案是学生选课的重要依据。学生应全面了解本专业\n的教学要求，在规定学习年限内按照人才培养方案的要求修读专业选修课和\n公共选修课，取得规定的学分，以达到毕业要求。选修网络公选课一般不能\n超过人才培养方案要求选修课的一半学分。",
      "contentChecksum": "056217b8775854fbadb44fff38af48c1ed37e1c3b0c92563e1681186387ffeb2",
      "span": {
        "unit": "UTF16_CODE_UNIT",
        "startInclusive": 0,
        "endExclusive": 119
      },
      "physicalPage": 76,
      "printedPage": 64,
      "locatorId": "handbook-2025-article-8",
      "article": 8,
      "chunkIndex": 4,
      "sourceLocator": "PDF物理第76页／印刷第64页，第8条"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": null,
      "chunkId": null,
      "referenceRevision": "2025.9.2",
      "knowledgeScope": "RULE_CHECK_PUBLIC_ELECTIVE_2025",
      "profileId": null,
      "chunkingVersion": "handbook-2025-clause-verbatim-v1",
      "publicationStatus": "DRAFT",
      "visibilityScope": "INTERNAL_ONLY",
      "sharingRightsConfirmed": false,
      "content": "第九条　学生应根据教务处公布的公共选修课开课计划，在规定时间内\n完成网上选课。未经选课者，不得参加课程考核或考核成绩无效。",
      "contentChecksum": "52f7661f0d5ac579a69f2506b37552b38279cc82fd267c8262bcb0fba176e303",
      "span": {
        "unit": "UTF16_CODE_UNIT",
        "startInclusive": 0,
        "endExclusive": 61
      },
      "physicalPage": 77,
      "printedPage": 65,
      "locatorId": "handbook-2025-article-9",
      "article": 9,
      "chunkIndex": 5,
      "sourceLocator": "PDF物理第77页／印刷第65页，第9条"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": null,
      "chunkId": null,
      "referenceRevision": "2025.9.2",
      "knowledgeScope": "RULE_CHECK_PUBLIC_ELECTIVE_2025",
      "profileId": null,
      "chunkingVersion": "handbook-2025-clause-verbatim-v1",
      "publicationStatus": "DRAFT",
      "visibilityScope": "INTERNAL_ONLY",
      "sharingRightsConfirmed": false,
      "content": "第十条　每学期选修公共选修课最高不得超过 4 个学分。",
      "contentChecksum": "cd02ac0ab183f2a9f22b0e7129ce5fb6e7bdbb8d4c9dc4011413fabdc6adba24",
      "span": {
        "unit": "UTF16_CODE_UNIT",
        "startInclusive": 0,
        "endExclusive": 27
      },
      "physicalPage": 77,
      "printedPage": 65,
      "locatorId": "handbook-2025-article-10",
      "article": 10,
      "chunkIndex": 6,
      "sourceLocator": "PDF物理第77页／印刷第65页，第10条"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": null,
      "chunkId": null,
      "referenceRevision": "2025.9.2",
      "knowledgeScope": "RULE_CHECK_PUBLIC_ELECTIVE_2025",
      "profileId": null,
      "chunkingVersion": "handbook-2025-clause-verbatim-v1",
      "publicationStatus": "DRAFT",
      "visibilityScope": "INTERNAL_ONLY",
      "sharingRightsConfirmed": false,
      "content": "第十一条　学生不得选修与本专业教学计划相同或相近的课程。已考核\n合格的课程，不可重复修读。",
      "contentChecksum": "e1a9646cc11334e64ecf233b86ae27760b0d00d5638b623c1635bce7bf04503d",
      "span": {
        "unit": "UTF16_CODE_UNIT",
        "startInclusive": 0,
        "endExclusive": 45
      },
      "physicalPage": 77,
      "printedPage": 65,
      "locatorId": "handbook-2025-article-11",
      "article": 11,
      "chunkIndex": 7,
      "sourceLocator": "PDF物理第77页／印刷第65页，第11条"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": null,
      "chunkId": null,
      "referenceRevision": "2025.9.2",
      "knowledgeScope": "RULE_CHECK_PUBLIC_ELECTIVE_2025",
      "profileId": null,
      "chunkingVersion": "handbook-2025-clause-verbatim-v1",
      "publicationStatus": "DRAFT",
      "visibilityScope": "INTERNAL_ONLY",
      "sharingRightsConfirmed": false,
      "content": "第十二条　选修课同必修课均在开课前一个学期排课。确定学期开课计\n划后，教务处首先安排必修课和专业选修课并保证必修课和专业选修课上课\n时间不冲突。然后，安排全校性公共选修课。",
      "contentChecksum": "2985f3667b0e62bb19055ea9ee795b53cd0192a0da43d893fa612b73f876d9ae",
      "span": {
        "unit": "UTF16_CODE_UNIT",
        "startInclusive": 0,
        "endExclusive": 86
      },
      "physicalPage": 77,
      "printedPage": 65,
      "locatorId": "handbook-2025-article-12",
      "article": 12,
      "chunkIndex": 8,
      "sourceLocator": "PDF物理第77页／印刷第65页，第12条"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": null,
      "chunkId": null,
      "referenceRevision": "2025.9.2",
      "knowledgeScope": "RULE_CHECK_PUBLIC_ELECTIVE_2025",
      "profileId": null,
      "chunkingVersion": "handbook-2025-clause-verbatim-v1",
      "publicationStatus": "DRAFT",
      "visibilityScope": "INTERNAL_ONLY",
      "sharingRightsConfirmed": false,
      "content": "第十八条　公共选修课不办理缓考，成绩不合格者不安排重修。专业选\n修课成绩不合格者可申请重修学习。",
      "contentChecksum": "536d5a6e2b78cb628f065dcba8e3ca48efc662728d0c6e4e056d1a8322173345",
      "span": {
        "unit": "UTF16_CODE_UNIT",
